---
import '../editor/style.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f5ef" />
    <meta name="description" content="An experiment in making creatures. Shape a spine and watch a skin grow around it." />
    <title>SporeTest · Creature workshop</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Cpath fill='%23627c69' d='M6 23C-2 13 9 2 19 5S35 23 23 27 9 27 6 23Z'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} aria-label="SporeTest home"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 24C0 18 3 7 12 5s20 6 17 14-15 11-22 5Z" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="2" fill="#f6f5ef"/><circle cx="21" cy="17" r="2" fill="#f6f5ef"/></svg>spore<span>test</span></a>
      <div class="project-label">CREATURE WORKSHOP <span>03 / LIMBS & SOCKETS</span></div>
      <div class="topbar-actions">
        <span id="local-save" class="local-save" role="status">Changes save in this browser</span>
        <button id="load" class="button">Load recipe</button>
        <input id="recipe-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" hidden />
        <button id="save" class="button primary">Save recipe <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main class="workspace">
      <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="Creature controls">
        <div class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE EXPERIMENT IN LIFE</span><h1>Make something<br/>unfamiliar.</h1><p>Start with a spine.<br/>See what grows around it.</p></div>
        <section id="gait-controls" class="gait-section" hidden>
          <div class="section-heading"><h2>Gait playground</h2><span>WALK PREVIEW</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="show-performance" type="checkbox" /><span>Show frame timings</span></label>
          <p id="motion-performance" class="rig-explanation" title="One-second frame averages. GPU timings are asynchronous when supported. Key timing starts in the event handler and ends at render submission; it excludes OS input queue, GPU completion, and display latency." hidden>Measuring frame timings.</p>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="walk-around" type="checkbox" /><span>Walk around with WASD</span></label>
          <div id="roam-controls" hidden>
            <p class="rig-explanation">Click the area, then hold W/S to move forward/backward and A/D to strafe left/right. Combine keys to move diagonally. Release to stop. Ground rings are 5 m apart. Drag to orbit.</p>
            <div class="button-row"><button id="roam-forward" class="button">Forward</button><button id="roam-reverse" class="button">Reverse</button></div>
            <div class="button-row"><button id="roam-left" class="button">Strafe left</button><button id="roam-right" class="button">Strafe right</button><button id="roam-stop" class="button">Stop</button></div>
            <p class="rig-explanation">Buttons keep moving until Stop. Clicking outside the area or switching tabs stops movement.</p>
            <p class="rig-explanation">Walk-around travels and steps three times faster than the inspection preview. Travel speed scales WASD and button movement. After adjusting it, click the area to drive again.</p>
            <p id="roam-position" class="rig-explanation">Position 0.00, 0.00 m</p>
          </div>
          <div class="range-label"><label for="gait-duty">Duty factor</label><output id="gait-duty-output" for="gait-duty">65% planted</output></div>
          <input id="gait-duty" type="range" min="0.2" max="0.9" step="0.01" value="0.65" />
          <div class="range-label"><label for="gait-period">Cycle duration</label><output id="gait-period-output" for="gait-period">1.80 s</output></div>
          <input id="gait-period" type="range" min="0.6" max="4" step="0.05" value="1.8" />
          <div class="range-label"><label for="gait-lift">Foot lift</label><output id="gait-lift-output" for="gait-lift">12% leg length</output></div>
          <input id="gait-lift" type="range" min="0" max="0.4" step="0.01" value="0.12" />
          <p class="rig-explanation">Cycle duration sets the shortest leg group's rhythm. Longer groups keep their relative timing. Tuning resamples the current instant.</p>
          <button id="gait-reset" class="button quiet">Reset gait settings</button>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="walk-body">Body motion</label><output id="walk-body-output" for="walk-body">50%</output></div>
          <input id="walk-body" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.5" />
          <p class="rig-explanation">Gentle bob and tilt with each step. Zero turns it off. Motion eases back when feet need more reach.</p>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="walk-tail">Tail follow-through</label><output id="walk-tail-output" for="walk-tail">70%</output></div>
          <input id="walk-tail" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.7" />
          <p class="rig-explanation">Attached tails lag behind body bob and tilt, then settle. Requires Body motion above zero. Longer tails respond more slowly.</p>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="walk-lean">Movement lean</label><output id="walk-lean-output" for="walk-lean">50%</output></div>
          <input id="walk-lean" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.5" />
          <div class="range-label"><label for="walk-sway">Tail sway</label><output id="walk-sway-output" for="walk-sway">70%</output></div>
          <input id="walk-sway" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.7" />
          <p class="rig-explanation">Lean into acceleration and turns; tails sway outward and trail direction changes. Braking eases the reaction back to rest.</p>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="walk-transfer">Weight transfer</label><output id="walk-transfer-output" for="walk-transfer">0%</output></div>
          <input id="walk-transfer" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0" />
          <div class="range-label"><label for="walk-transfer-limit">Torso travel limit</label><output id="walk-transfer-limit-output" for="walk-transfer-limit">0.15 m</output></div>
          <input id="walk-transfer-limit" type="range" min="0" max="0.3" step="0.01" value="0.15" />
          <p id="walk-transfer-status" class="rig-explanation">Weight transfer off.</p>
          <p class="rig-explanation gait-legend">Shift toward supporting feet before lift-off. Starts briefly prepare support before stepping. Zero strength gives the original torso motion. Contact errors still report unreachable poses.</p>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="walk-speed">Travel speed</label><output id="walk-speed-output" for="walk-speed">1.00× · 0.000 m/s</output></div>
          <input id="walk-speed" type="range" min="0" max="2" step="0.05" value="1" />
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="walk-turn">Turn rate</label><output id="walk-turn-output" for="walk-turn">Straight</output></div>
          <input id="walk-turn" type="range" min="-45" max="45" step="1" value="0" />
          <button id="walk-straight" class="button quiet">Steer straight</button>
          <p class="rig-explanation gait-legend">Left to turn left, right to turn right. Rate is at baseline travel speed; slowing also slows the turn. Planted feet hold their ground. Tight turns can exceed reach, shown by orange contact rings.</p>
          <div class="button-row"><button id="walk-motion" class="button">Stop walking</button><span id="walk-motion-status" class="motion-status">Starting</span></div>
          <p class="rig-explanation gait-legend">Stop walking slows the body, lets lifted feet land, then settles one foot at a time into the standing stance. Start walking can interrupt settling. Pause freezes time.</p>
          <div class="resolution"><label for="walk-rate">Playback speed</label><select id="walk-rate"><option value="0.1">0.1×</option><option value="0.25">0.25×</option><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option value="1" selected>1×</option></select></div>
          <div class="button-row gait-transport">
            <button id="walk-pause" class="button">Pause</button>
            <button id="walk-step" class="button" title="Pause and advance 1/60 second">Step 1/60 s</button>
            <button id="walk-restart" class="button" title="Return to zero seconds">↶ Start</button>
          </div>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="walk-time">Elapsed time</label><output id="walk-time-output" for="walk-time">0.000 s</output></div>
          <input id="walk-time" type="range" min="0" max="30" step="0.001" value="0" />
          <label class="toggle"><input id="walk-targets" type="checkbox" checked /><span>Show foot targets</span></label>
          <p class="rig-explanation gait-legend">Blue targets show intended sole positions and lift. Floor rings mark planted feet: green within 1 cm, orange for misses. Scrubbing pauses playback. These controls are not saved in the recipe.</p>
        </section>
        <section id="balance-controls" class="gait-section" hidden>
          <div class="section-heading"><h2>Support check</h2><span id="balance-feet">0 feet</span></div>
          <p id="balance-status" class="rig-explanation">Enter Stand or Walk to inspect support.</p>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="show-balance" type="checkbox" checked /><span>Show centre and support area</span></label>
          <div id="standing-correction">
            <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="stand-strength">Torso correction</label><output id="stand-strength-output" for="stand-strength">0%</output></div>
            <input id="stand-strength" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0" />
            <div class="range-label"><label for="stand-shift">Shift limit</label><output id="stand-shift-output" for="stand-shift">0.25 m</output></div>
            <input id="stand-shift" type="range" min="0" max="0.5" step="0.01" value="0.25" />
            <p id="stand-correction-status" class="rig-explanation">Increase correction to shift the torso toward support.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="rig-explanation gait-legend">Purple estimates the centre of mass using uniform mass over the skin surface. Green outlines the contact area under planted feet. An orange projection falls outside that area. This is a static check, not a test of balance in motion.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="spine-section">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2>Spine</h2><span id="spine-count">5 vertebrae</span></div>
          <div class="chain-labels"><span>HEAD</span><span>TAIL</span></div>
          <div id="vertebrae" class="vertebrae" role="group" aria-label="Select a vertebra"></div>
          <div class="button-row"><button id="add" class="button">+ Add after</button><button id="remove" class="button quiet">Remove</button></div>
          <p class="rig-explanation">Spine dragging stays on the mirror plane. Z allows deliberate sideways edits.</p>
          <button id="align-spine" class="button quiet" disabled>Align spine</button>
        </section>
        <section class="shape-section">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="selected-label">Vertebra 3</h2><span class="selection-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
          <div class="range-label"><label for="radius">Radius</label><output id="radius-output" for="radius">0.76 m</output></div>
          <input id="radius" type="range" min="0.1" max="1.6" step="0.01" value="0.76" />
          <div class="axis-label">Position <span>metres</span></div>
          <div class="coordinates">
            <label><span>X</span><input id="position-x" type="number" step="0.1" aria-label="Position X" /></label>
            <label><span>Y</span><input id="position-y" type="number" step="0.1" aria-label="Position Y" /></label>
            <label><span>Z</span><input id="position-z" type="number" step="0.1" aria-label="Position Z" /></label>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="limbs" class="limb-section"></section>
        <section class="skin-section">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2>Skin</h2><span>CLAY STUDIES</span></div>
          <div class="swatches" role="group" aria-label="Skin colour">
            <button data-color="#91ae9e" style="--swatch:#91ae9e" aria-label="Sage skin" aria-pressed="true"></button>
            <button data-color="#c58e74" style="--swatch:#c58e74" aria-label="Terracotta skin" aria-pressed="false"></button>
            <button data-color="#b2a1c3" style="--swatch:#b2a1c3" aria-label="Lilac skin" aria-pressed="false"></button>
            <button data-color="#d6ba72" style="--swatch:#d6ba72" aria-label="Ochre skin" aria-pressed="false"></button>
            <button data-color="#82a8b6" style="--swatch:#82a8b6" aria-label="Blue skin" aria-pressed="false"></button>
            <button data-color="#d1cbc0" style="--swatch:#d1cbc0" aria-label="Chalk skin" aria-pressed="false"></button>
          </div>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="show-spine" type="checkbox" checked/><span>Show skeleton</span></label>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="wireframe" type="checkbox"/><span>Wireframe</span></label>
          <div class="resolution"><label for="resolution">Skin detail</label><select id="resolution"><option value="3">Draft</option><option value="4" selected>Balanced</option><option value="6">Fine</option></select></div>
        </section>
        <section class="rig-section">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2>Binding check</h2><span id="bone-count">Building rig…</span></div>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="ik-preview" type="checkbox" disabled/><span>Preview IK</span></label>
          <p class="rig-explanation">Drag orange head, tail, foot or grasper targets to pose the creature. The body responds before the limbs reach. Turn off IK to return to shaping.</p>
          <p class="rig-explanation">Bend the skeleton to inspect how the skin follows.</p>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="preview-pose" type="checkbox"/><span>Preview pose</span></label>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="bend">Bend</label><output id="bend-output" for="bend">45°</output></div>
          <input id="bend" type="range" min="-90" max="90" step="1" value="45" disabled/>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="limb-bend">Limb flex</label><output id="limb-bend-output" for="limb-bend">0°</output></div>
          <input id="limb-bend" type="range" min="-45" max="45" step="1" value="0" disabled/>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="sweep" type="checkbox" disabled/><span>Sweep through the bend</span></label>
          <div class="range-label rig-range"><label for="smoothing">Weight smoothing</label><output id="smoothing-output" for="smoothing">4 passes</output></div>
          <input id="smoothing" type="range" min="0" max="12" step="1" value="4"/>
          <p class="rig-explanation">Zero passes shows raw provenance. Posing never remeshes; smoothing only rebinds.</p>
          <div class="binding-metrics"><span>Bind <b id="bind-time">—</b></span><span title="Largest weight fraction discarded at any vertex when retaining four GPU influences">GPU reduction <b id="discarded">—</b></span></div>
        </section>
        <div class="sidebar-foot"><span class="small-dot"></span> Handmade by you. Meshed by maths.</div>
      </aside>
      <section id="viewport" aria-label="Creature workshop">
        <div class="placement-toolbar" role="group" aria-label="Creature tools">
          <button id="tool-shape" class="button" aria-pressed="true">Shape</button>
          <button id="tool-leg" class="button" aria-pressed="false">Leg</button>
          <button id="tool-arm" class="button" aria-pressed="false">Arm</button>
          <button id="tool-tail" class="button" aria-pressed="false">Tail</button>
          <button id="tool-ik" class="button" aria-pressed="false" disabled>IK</button>
          <button id="tool-stand" class="button" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Stand</button>
          <button id="tool-walk" class="button" aria-pressed="false" disabled>Walk</button>
          <label class="toggle"><input id="mirror-placement" type="checkbox" disabled/><span>Mirror</span></label>
          <span id="placement-hint" role="status">Drag points to shape</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viewport-top"><div class="specimen"><span class="eyebrow">UNTITLED CREATURE</span><span>Study no. 001</span></div><div class="view-actions"><button class="icon-button" id="undo" title="Undo" aria-label="Undo" disabled>↶</button><button class="icon-button" id="redo" title="Redo" aria-label="Redo" disabled>↷</button><span class="divider"></span><button class="button glass" id="frame">Frame creature</button><button class="icon-button" id="reset" title="Start over" aria-label="Start over">⟲</button></div></div>
        <div id="error" class="error" role="alert" hidden></div>
        <div class="viewport-bottom"><div class="hint"><span class="hint-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><strong id="viewport-hint">Pull a point. Change a creature.</strong><span id="viewport-help">Drag a vertebra to shape · Drag the background to orbit · Scroll to zoom</span></div></div><span class="axis-key">Y UP <span>·</span> METRES</span></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="statusbar"><div><span class="small-dot"></span><span id="status" role="status">Starting…</span></div><div class="metrics"><span><b id="triangles">—</b> triangles</span><span>Mesh <b id="mesh-time">—</b></span><span>Cell <b id="cell-size">—</b></span><span>Builds <b id="builds">0</b></span></div><span class="stage-label">SPINE → SKIN → RIG → POSE</span></footer>
    <script>
      import '../editor/bootstrap.ts';
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
